[size=5][b]Credits and AI disclosure[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Soviet marshal cap (Stalin 1945): adapted from [url=https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/russian-imperial-ww1-army-cap-d5d8d1c2636946a1adbaaeb2fe5dcd92]"Russian Imperial WW1 Army Cap"[/url] by [url=https://sketchfab.com/dawiderodawid]dawiderodawid[/url], [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/]CC BY 4.0[/url]. Converted to the game's format, repositioned, rescaled and repainted.
[*]Leader narration: generated with [url=https://huggingface.co/coqui/XTTS-v2]Coqui XTTS-v2[/url] using a stock studio voice (no real person's voice was cloned), under the Coqui Public Model License (non-commercial use).
[*]Much of the code, texts and translations were written with the help of generative AI (Claude), under the author's direction and testing.
[/list]

